{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why This Adventure Feels Special</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>pencil-drawn</strong> visuals bring a nostalgic, delicate art style that feels like walking through a dreamscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A <strong>sole developer</strong> passion project\u2014every scene, puzzle, and detail radiates authenticity and care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/extras/430a9fa40d7163933e77749d6c277e30.poster.avif?t=1753692430\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/extras/430a9fa40d7163933e77749d6c277e30.webm?t=1753692430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/extras/430a9fa40d7163933e77749d6c277e30.mp4?t=1753692430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Puzzles, Memorable Interactions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Navigate intuitive point\u2011and\u2011click gameplay with inventory-based logic and dialogue-based challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Solve imaginative tasks\u2014like returning a favor to a neighbor using a petroleum-soaked doormat\u2014in a neighborhood riddled with quirky characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Players love the blend of lighthearted humor and subtle emotional depth, even as tasks reveal stories of everyday hardship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Designed for a cozy evening: playtime is typically around 3 hours, perfect for a cold winter night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Includes 11 Steam achievements, captions, and full language support in English, Ukrainian, German and russian.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Crow let it go!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558730/be37e731a007d4a991d22182a1dfc8b24800fe8e.jpg"},{"name":"The last trolleybus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558730/c823c46ded733308883a8bdc8cc5abbc46317968.jpg"},{"name":"Domino Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558730/c136ac6dd0f63e98372302e90e01cdc8b5a19471.jpg"},{"name":"Lost drawing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558730/ca625c1a42bc285a582277f6d35bd933b22000be.jpg"},{"name":"Good deed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558730/2a25b06ec85b00255b498016e49d3fe9001412c1.jpg"},{"name":"Television","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558730/f2393ae6bbd6dcc9a0ff3d64679ebf6eca59350e.jpg"},{"name":"Savings saved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558730/4345aded5ac7ee9affdd4a9474a4c134a71e0402.jpg"},{"name":"Lost shovel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558730/6777f407ae5356c0d36458089b899bf82b81175e.jpg"},{"name":"The snowman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558730/819efcfade169edf2221fbdfb4ae96b574564389.jpg"},{"name":"My cat is back!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1558730/1cf40180cd6b9e70ff90230a738e4df08c396ccc.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1558730?t=1753692430","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753692430","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/6e1a07cc23c598e8409834b6b31ebd9827bd1f2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753692430","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/6e1a07cc23c598e8409834b6b31ebd9827bd1f2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753692430","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why This Adventure Feels Special</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <strong>pencil-drawn</strong> visuals bring a nostalgic, delicate art style that feels like walking through a dreamscape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A <strong>sole developer</strong> passion project\u2014every scene, puzzle, and detail radiates authenticity and care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/extras/430a9fa40d7163933e77749d6c277e30.poster.avif?t=1753692430\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/extras/430a9fa40d7163933e77749d6c277e30.webm?t=1753692430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/extras/430a9fa40d7163933e77749d6c277e30.mp4?t=1753692430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Puzzles, Memorable Interactions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Navigate intuitive point\u2011and\u2011click gameplay with inventory-based logic and dialogue-based challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Solve imaginative tasks\u2014like returning a favor to a neighbor using a petroleum-soaked doormat\u2014in a neighborhood riddled with quirky characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Players love the blend of lighthearted humor and subtle emotional depth, even as tasks reveal stories of everyday hardship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Designed for a cozy evening: playtime is typically around 3 hours, perfect for a cold winter night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Includes 11 Steam achievements, captions, and full language support in English, Ukrainian, German and russian.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Nezhysoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1558730/69f360382f3a154effd509e0eed7ed7af096fad0/header.jpg?t=1753692430","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1558730/506976/de13e08ed5c28a624c84688c5dc15bed4c333aea/1751003095/dash_av1.mpd?t=1703705756","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1558730/506976/de13e08ed5c28a624c84688c5dc15bed4c333aea/1751003095/dash_h264.mpd?t=1703705756","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1558730/506976/de13e08ed5c28a624c84688c5dc15bed4c333aea/1751003095/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1703705756","id":256912152,"name":"Trailer Alexey's Winter: Night Adventure","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256912152/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1703705756"}],"name":"Alexey's Winter: Night Adventure","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":